  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-plugin-browser",
      "text": "> **Native Headless & Visible Web Browser Automation Agent Plugin for DeepSeek Harness (`dsh`)**\n\n[](LICENSE)\n[](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness)\n\n`dsh-plugin-browser` empowers DeepSeek Harness agents with native web browsing, live page content extraction, DOM parsing, form interaction, and visual screenshot verification.\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- 🌐 **Web Navigation & Exploration**: Navigate to any public or internal website URL.\n- 📄 **Semantic Markdown & Link Extraction**: Convert complex HTML pages into clean, token-efficient Markdown.\n- 📸 **Visual Screenshots**: Capture high-resolution visual snapshots for multi-modal verification.\n- 💻 **CLI Utility (`dsh-browser`)**: Direct terminal commands (`open`, `extract`, `screenshot`).\n- 🧩 **Cordis Native**: Automatically exposes `browser_navigate`, `browser_extract`, and `browser_screenshot` tools."
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "section": "Installation",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "Add from GitHub",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add \"github:menotbobbybrown/dsh-plugin-browser\"\n```\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "CLI Usage",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "Navigate to a URL and inspect HTTP status",
      "text": "npx dsh-browser open https://news.ycombinator.com"
    },
    {
      "section": "Extract clean Markdown and hyperlinks",
      "text": "npx dsh-browser extract https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness"
    },
    {
      "section": "Capture a screenshot",
      "text": "npx dsh-browser screenshot https://github.com my_screenshot.png\n```\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "Programmatic Usage (Cordis API)",
      "text": "```typescript\nimport { Context } from 'cordis';\nimport * as BrowserPlugin from 'dsh-plugin-browser';\n\nconst ctx = new Context();\n\n---"
    },
